A closed door has a sound too, and we start with that one.</p></td></tr></table><div style="height:18px;line-height:18px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">Nobody will ask you to scream, and nobody is put on the spot. Nothing here needs you to be ready.</p></td></tr>
