       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.

For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.

I''m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I''m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.

You don''t need a retreat to begin. The workshop is seventy minutes, live on Zoom. You ask a question your mind can''t answer first, you breathe in, and you let your body make one tone: the tone of what''s there, right now. That is where the listening starts.

If you have never made a sound with us, come and listen to your own body. Through Monday 30 November a seat is half price.


WHAT PEOPLE TELL ME BEFORE THE FIRST TIME

- "I can''t sing.": Good. This isn''t singing. You don''t need a good voice, you need your honest one. There is no melody to hit and nobody to please. You cannot do it wrong; it will always express something.
- "Someone will hear me.": Not in the workshop. Your microphone stays off unless you want it on, so the only one who hears your sound is you. And if it is the people at home you are thinking of: that is the most common question in this work. Some people start in their car or their bathroom. Soft counts.
- "What if nothing comes?": Then that is what''s there. A closed door has a sound too, and we start with that one.

Nobody will ask you to scream, and nobody is put on the spot. Nothing here needs you to be ready.


THE WORKSHOP, 50% OFF: EUR 11 instead of EUR 22
Seventy minutes, live on Zoom: an introduction to Somatic Vocal Healing, a somatic warm-up with live piano, guided sounding, and a first tool for everyday life. Your microphone stays off unless you want it on. Replay included.
https://songdance.co/workshop?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=a-new2_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. You don''t have to be free this weekend. Any date on the page counts, also one in a few weeks, as long as you register before Monday night.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
'
 WHERE name = 'BFCM A2 · Sat 28 Nov · reminder · new: never a workshop or masterclass' AND status = 'draft'
   AND length(body) IN (11694, 11693);

