ily:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Nothing in you is broken. It just hasn&rsquo;t been heard for a long time.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">That is all the workshop is: seventy minutes of hearing it. You ask a question your mind can&rsquo;t answer first, you breathe in, and you let your body make one tone. One tone is the whole instruction. The rest we do together.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">This is my last note about the half price. After tonight a seat is &euro;22 again. If you were going to come one day anyway, today it is &euro;11.</p></td></tr>
