       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

To stay safe. To belong. To not take up too much space. Over time that becomes a body that''s holding a lot. Tension. A tight throat. The feeling that some part of you never quite arrives.

Nothing in you is broken. It just hasn''t been heard for a long time.

That is all the workshop is: seventy minutes of hearing it. You ask a question your mind can''t answer first, you breathe in, and you let your body make one tone. One tone is the whole instruction. The rest we do together.

This is my last note about the half price. After tonight a seat is EUR 22 again. If you were going to come one day anyway, today it is EUR 11.



THE WORKSHOP, 50% OFF: EUR 11 instead of EUR 22
Seventy minutes, live on Zoom: an introduction to Somatic Vocal Healing, a somatic warm-up with live piano, guided sounding, and a first tool for everyday life. Your microphone stays off unless you want it on. Replay included.
https://songdance.co/workshop?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=a-new3_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.)

See you in the circle,
Jacob

P.S. Tonight means the end of Monday, wherever you are. And any date on the page counts, also one in a few weeks.

--
