       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.

For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.

I''m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I''m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.

You have sounded with us, in a workshop or a masterclass, so you know the first taste of this. What she was describing is what it is like once it is yours: a way of listening you can come back to on an ordinary day, at home.

That takes more than one hour. It takes a while, and a map. That is the 12-week course, and through Monday 30 November it is half price. So is the certification path, for those who want to hold space for others.


FOR YOURSELF, OR FOR OTHERS TOO?

If you want this for yourself: the 12-week course. A practice that fits in a kitchen. Twelve modules, a live hour with me every week from the day you join, and the materials stay yours for life.

If people already come to you with what they carry: the certification path. First the same 12 weeks, because nobody holds space for a sound they haven''t made themselves. Then nine months of learning to hold that space. A space holder, not a healer: the person in front of you heals themselves. And you get to be there when someone finds what she found.

TWELVE MODULES, ONE PRACTICE

What the 12-week course walks through, at your own pace, with a live Q&A every week to bring your questions to:

- 1 · Understanding vocal sound: Singing, toning, chanting, sounding, and why this practice is its own thing.
- 2 · Becoming comfortable: Meeting the collective unease around using the voice.
- 3 · Holding space: Steady, grounded footing for sound work, for yourself and others.
- 4 · Reading your sound: Hearing the feeling and the pattern inside the voice.
- 5 · Neuroanatomy: The brain, the body and the voice, in plain terms.
- 6 · Nervous system flow: Using sound to regulate and settle.
- 7 · The five core wounds: Rejection, abandonment, betrayal, humiliation, injustice. Met at your own pace, through sound.
- 8 · Sounding toward essence: A meditation that listens toward your own essential sound.
- 9 · Sounds of the chakras: The energy centres, explored through tone.
- 10 · Sounding with instruments: Voice with drum, shruti, or singing bowl.
- 11 · Practising with others: First steps in sounding together.
- 12 · Self-healing & integration: Carrying the practice forward on your own.

AND IN THE NINE MONTHS AFTER

The certification path adds the training in holding space for someone else. There you learn:

- To travel through the layers of a sound: How to recognise feelings in a voice (high, low, trembling, sharp), how to follow what is underneath the first sound, and how to guide a whole session from beginning to end.
- The emotions underneath: Anger, fear, pain and grief. How each one moves, how it disguises itself, and how to meet it through the voice.
- Listening with the body: Telling grief from pain, fear from overwhelm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.
- Skills for holding the space: Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.


THE 12-WEEK COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 275 instead of EUR 550
18+ hours of video across 12 modules, twelve weeks of weekly live Q&As with me, a student community, lifetime access to the materials. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/12-week?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop2_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE CERTIFICATION PATH, 50% OFF: EUR 670 instead of EUR 1,347
The 12-week course, then the nine-month certification course: class library and manuals, weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop2_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. The 12-week course can become the path later. But the path at half price is this weekend.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
