       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

This is my last note about it.

If the workshop stayed with you, and a small yes has been waiting, tonight is when the price goes back: the 12-week course to EUR 550, the path to EUR 1,347.

And if now isn''t the time, that is an honest answer too. Trees don''t hurry.


WHAT NO COURSE PAGE USUALLY ADMITS

Sometimes you''ll feel lighter. Sometimes you''ll meet something tender first. If all you want is a pleasant hour, there are gentler tools, and they can be good ones.

But if you''re willing to meet the parts that have been waiting, the old fear, the grief, the anger, what''s on the other side isn''t a quick boost. It''s a steadier kind of peace.


THE 12-WEEK COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 275 instead of EUR 550
18+ hours of video across 12 modules, twelve weeks of weekly live Q&As with me, a student community, lifetime access to the materials. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/12-week?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop3_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE CERTIFICATION PATH, 50% OFF: EUR 670 instead of EUR 1,347
The 12-week course, then the nine-month certification course: class library and manuals, weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop3_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. Tonight means the end of Monday, wherever you are.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
