<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EADFCB;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
<span class="preheader">What a woman told me at the retreat I’m giving. The certification course at half price, live passes 20% off, through Monday.&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;</span>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#EADFCB;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="wrapper" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td align="center" style="background-color:#2A1B2A;padding:11px 20px;text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#F4ECDF;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">Black Friday &middot; through Monday 30&nbsp;November</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:38px 44px 6px;"><table role="presentation" dir="rtl" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td dir="ltr" class="seal-td" width="176" valign="top" align="right" style="width:176px;padding:0;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=c-12w-ended2_hero&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:block;"><img class="seal-img seal-img2" src="https://songdance.co/email/bfcm/seal-certification-pass.png" width="176" alt="50% off the certification course, 20% off live passes" style="width:176px;height:auto;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#A14826;"></a></td><td dir="ltr" class="hd-td" valign="top" align="left" style="padding:0 14px 0 0;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><p class="eye" style="margin:0 0 22px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#A14826;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#A14826;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px;"></span>For those who did the 12 weeks</p><h1 class="h1b" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:38px;line-height:1.14;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 28px;">Today at lunch, <br><em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">tears of joy.</em></h1></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">I&rsquo;m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I&rsquo;m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">You did the twelve weeks, so you know this from the inside: what it is to ask your body and hear it answer.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">There is a second joy, and I had it at that lunch table: being there when someone else finds this. That is what the certification course is for: nine months of learning to hold space while another person sounds. You don&rsquo;t heal anyone. They do that themselves. You keep the room steady, ask the next honest question, and witness.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">It is half price through Monday 30&nbsp;November. And if what you miss is simply the live sessions with us, a live pass is 20% off.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">What you learn in the <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">certification course</em></h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Your 12 weeks were for your own practice. These nine months are about sitting with someone else while they sound:</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">To travel through the layers of a sound</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">How to recognise feelings in a voice (high, low, trembling, sharp), how to follow what is underneath the first sound, and how to guide a whole session from beginning to end.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The emotions underneath</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Anger, fear, pain and grief. How each one moves, how it disguises itself, and how to meet it through the voice.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Listening with the body</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Telling grief from pain, fear from overwhelm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Skills for holding the space</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.</p></td></tr></table><div style="height:18px;line-height:18px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">A note on what it is not: it is not a comprehensive training to become a therapist, coach or psychologist. It is a course in Somatic Vocal Healing specifically. If you mean to work with clients professionally, you should already have a background in holding space.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">You don&rsquo;t have to <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">do it alone.</em></h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">A practice kept alone tends to go quiet. Not because anything went wrong. Life is loud, and there is nobody to ask &ldquo;what is below that?&rdquo; when you would rather not look. That is what the live sessions are for:</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The weekly Q&amp;A</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">A live hour. This is where the smaller, in-between questions are met, where you bring what came up in a practice and we look at it together. Each replay stays available for two months.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The monthly deepening session</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Two hours on one theme, with the wider community of practitioners.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:26px 44px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#4A2540;border-radius:4px;"><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 36px 32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#E7C9B8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">The certification course &middot; 50% off</p><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0 0 14px;">Nine months, to hold space for others</h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#EADFCB;margin:0 0 18px;">The class library and written manuals, nine months of weekly Q&amp;As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together with fellow students, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. You already have the foundation, so you take it on its own.</p><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#C9B4C3;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;797</span>&nbsp; &euro;395<span style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#C9B4C3;"> </span></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:22px 0 12px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:32px;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=c-12w-ended2_cta&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#4A2540;padding:15px 32px;text-decoration:none;">See the certification course &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9B4C3;margin:0;">The monthly plans are half price too. The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:26px 44px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#4A2540;border-radius:4px;"><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 36px 32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#E7C9B8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">The live pass &middot; 20% off</p><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0 0 14px;">Back into the live sessions</h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#EADFCB;margin:0 0 18px;">The weekly Q&amp;A, one live hour, and the monthly deepening session, two hours on one theme. A pass starts the day you buy it.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #6B4560;"><tr><td style="padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid #6B4560;vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;">1 month</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9B4C3;margin:2px 0 0;">4 Q&amp;As, 1 deepening session</p></td><td align="right" style="padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid #6B4560;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;">&euro;41</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9B4C3;margin:2px 0 0;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;52</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid #6B4560;vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;">3 months</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9B4C3;ma