       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.

For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.

I''m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I''m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.

You did the twelve weeks, so you know this from the inside: what it is to ask your body and hear it answer.

There is a second joy, and I had it at that lunch table: being there when someone else finds this. That is what the certification course is for: nine months of learning to hold space while another person sounds. You don''t heal anyone. They do that themselves. You keep the room steady, ask the next honest question, and witness.

It is half price through Monday 30 November. And if what you miss is simply the live sessions with us, a live pass is 20% off.


WHAT YOU LEARN IN THE CERTIFICATION COURSE

Your 12 weeks were for your own practice. These nine months are about sitting with someone else while they sound:

- To travel through the layers of a sound: How to recognise feelings in a voice (high, low, trembling, sharp), how to follow what is underneath the first sound, and how to guide a whole session from beginning to end.
- The emotions underneath: Anger, fear, pain and grief. How each one moves, how it disguises itself, and how to meet it through the voice.
- Listening with the body: Telling grief from pain, fear from overwhelm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.
- Skills for holding the space: Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.

A note on what it is not: it is not a comprehensive training to become a therapist, coach or psychologist. It is a course in Somatic Vocal Healing specifically. If you mean to work with clients professionally, you should already have a background in holding space.

YOU DON''T HAVE TO DO IT ALONE.

A practice kept alone tends to go quiet. Not because anything went wrong. Life is loud, and there is nobody to ask "what is below that?" when you would rather not look. That is what the live sessions are for:

- The weekly Q&A: A live hour. This is where the smaller, in-between questions are met, where you bring what came up in a practice and we look at it together. Each replay stays available for two months.
- The monthly deepening session: Two hours on one theme, with the wider community of practitioners.


THE CERTIFICATION COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 395 instead of EUR 797
The class library and manuals, nine months of weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. You already have the foundation, so you take it on its own. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=c-12w-ended2_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE LIVE PASS, 20% OFF
The weekly Q&A, one live hour, and the monthly deepening session, two hours on one theme.
1 month (4 Q&As, 1 deepening session): EUR 41 instead of EUR 52
3 months (12 Q&As, 3 deepening sessions): EUR 105 instead of EUR 132
6 months (24 Q&As, 6 deepening sessions): EUR 187 instead of EUR 234
12 months (48 Q&As, 12 deepening sessions): EUR 348 instead of EUR 436
Monthly, cancel any time: EUR 40 the first month (instead of EUR 52), then EUR 44 a month
A pass starts the day you buy it.
https://songdance.co/courses/live-pass?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=c-12w-ended2_text&{{prefill}}#lp-buy-title

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. A reply to this email reaches us. If you tell us where you are with the practice, we''ll tell you honestly which of the two fits.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
