0;vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;">Monthly</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9B4C3;margin:2px 0 0;">every session while it runs, cancel any time</p></td><td align="right" style="padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid #6B4560;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;">&euro;40, then &euro;44 a month</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9B4C3;margin:2px 0 0;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;52, then &euro;44</p></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:22px 0 12px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:32px;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/live-pass?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=c-12w-ended3_cta&amp;{{prefill}}#lp-buy-title" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#4A2540;padding:15px 32px;text-decoration:none;">Choose a live pass &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9B4C3;margin:0;">The monthly starts at &euro;40 for its first month. The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
