<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EADFCB;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
<span class="preheader">What a woman told me at the retreat I’m giving. And what comes after week twelve, discounted through Monday.&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;</span>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#EADFCB;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="wrapper" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td align="center" style="background-color:#2A1B2A;padding:11px 20px;text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#F4ECDF;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">Black Friday &middot; through Monday 30&nbsp;November</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:38px 44px 6px;"><table role="presentation" dir="rtl" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td dir="ltr" class="seal-td" width="176" valign="top" align="right" style="width:176px;padding:0;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=d-12w-late2_hero&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:block;"><img class="seal-img seal-img2" src="https://songdance.co/email/bfcm/seal-certification-pass.png" width="176" alt="50% off the certification course, 20% off live passes" style="width:176px;height:auto;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#A14826;"></a></td><td dir="ltr" class="hd-td" valign="top" align="left" style="padding:0 14px 0 0;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><p class="eye" style="margin:0 0 22px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#A14826;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#A14826;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px;"></span>Your 12 weeks, second half</p><h1 class="h1b" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:38px;line-height:1.14;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 28px;">Today at lunch, <br><em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">tears of joy.</em></h1></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">I&rsquo;m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I&rsquo;m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">You are in your own twelve weeks right now, so some of this may sound familiar.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">There is a second joy, and I had it at that lunch table: being there when someone else finds this. That is what the certification course is for: nine months of learning to hold space while another person sounds. You don&rsquo;t heal anyone. They do that themselves. You keep the room steady, ask the next honest question, and witness.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">The certification course</strong> begins when your 12 weeks are over, and it is half price through Monday 30&nbsp;November. <strong style="font-weight:600;">The live pass</strong> is for you if you simply want the weekly hour to continue: 20% off, and it also starts when your 12 weeks end.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">What you learn in <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">those nine months</em></h2><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">To travel through the layers of a sound</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">How to recognise feelings in a voice (high, low, trembling, sharp), how to follow what is underneath the first sound, and how to guide a whole session from beginning to end.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The emotions underneath</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Anger, fear, pain and grief. How each one moves, how it disguises itself, and how to meet it through the voice.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Listening with the body</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Telling grief from pain, fear from overwhelm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Skills for holding the space</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.</p></td></tr></table><div style="height:18px;line-height:18px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">A note on what it is not: it is not a comprehensive training to become a therapist, coach or psychologist. It is a course in Somatic Vocal Healing specifically. If you mean to work with clients professionally, you should already have a background in holding space.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">And what the pass <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">keeps open</em></h2><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The weekly Q&amp;A</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">A live hour. This is where the smaller, in-between questions are met, where you bring what came up in a practice and we look at it together. Each replay stays available for two months.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The monthly deepening session</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Two hours on one theme, with the wider community of practitioners.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
