<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EADFCB;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
<span class="preheader">What a woman told me at the retreat I’m giving. The certification course, half price through Monday.&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;</span>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#EADFCB;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="wrapper" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td align="center" style="background-color:#2A1B2A;padding:11px 20px;text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#F4ECDF;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">Black Friday &middot; through Monday 30&nbsp;November</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:38px 44px 6px;"><table role="presentation" dir="rtl" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td dir="ltr" class="seal-td" width="160" valign="top" align="right" style="width:160px;padding:0;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=e-12w-early2_hero&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:block;"><img class="seal-img" src="https://songdance.co/email/bfcm/seal-certification.png" width="160" alt="50% off the certification course" style="width:160px;height:auto;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#A14826;"></a></td><td dir="ltr" class="hd-td" valign="top" align="left" style="padding:0 14px 0 0;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><p class="eye" style="margin:0 0 22px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#A14826;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#A14826;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px;"></span>Your 12 weeks, just begun</p><h1 class="h1b" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:38px;line-height:1.14;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 28px;">Today at lunch, <br><em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">tears of joy.</em></h1></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Today at lunch a woman told me, in tears of joy, how surprised and relieved she is. She can finally listen to her body.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">For years she has been in and out of contact with it, and it has been a struggle. Now she has an easy way to hear her body speak to her, one she can come back to and whose wisdom she can rely on. That was the relief in her tears.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">I&rsquo;m giving a retreat right now. In moments like this, talking with the people here, I&rsquo;m reminded how truly simple and how powerful somatic sounding is.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">You have only just begun your twelve weeks, so you are at the start of this yourself. Take your time with it.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">There is a second joy, and I had it at that lunch table: being there when someone else finds this. That is what the certification course is for: nine months of learning to hold space while another person sounds. You don&rsquo;t heal anyone. They do that themselves. You keep the room steady, ask the next honest question, and witness.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">Some people know early that they want to learn that. If that is you: the certification course is half price through Monday 30&nbsp;November, and it begins when your 12 weeks are over. If you don&rsquo;t know yet, stay with your own twelve weeks. Your tempo is the right tempo.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">What you learn <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">there</em></h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">It is for therapists, coaches and bodyworkers who want this in their work, and for people who simply feel drawn to it.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">To travel through the layers of a sound</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">How to recognise feelings in a voice (high, low, trembling, sharp), how to follow what is underneath the first sound, and how to guide a whole session from beginning to end.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">The emotions underneath</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Anger, fear, pain and grief. How each one moves, how it disguises itself, and how to meet it through the voice.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Listening with the body</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Telling grief from pain, fear from overwhelm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Skills for holding the space</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.</p></td></tr></table><div style="height:18px;line-height:18px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">A note on what it is not: it is not a comprehensive training to become a therapist, coach or psychologist. It is a course in Somatic Vocal Healing specifically. If you mean to work with clients professionally, you should already have a background in holding space.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:26px 44px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#4A2540;border-radius:4px;"><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 36px 32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#E7C9B8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">The certification course &middot; 50% off</p><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0 0 14px;">Nine months, to hold space for others</h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#EADFCB;margin:0 0 18px;">The class library and written manuals, nine months of weekly Q&amp;As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together with fellow students, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. It begins when your 12 weeks are over, so nothing overlaps.</p><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#C9B4C3;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;797</span>&nbsp; &euro;395<span style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#C9B4C3;"> </span></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:22px 0 12px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:32px;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=e-12w-early2_cta&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#4A2540;padding:15px 32px;text-decoration:none;">See the certification course &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9B4C3;margin:0;">The monthly plans are half price too. The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 42px;"><p style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A3848;margin:0 0 28px;">With love,<br>Jacob</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3848;margin:0;"><strong style="font-weight:600;color:#2A1B2A;">P.S.</strong> You don&rsquo;t need to have finished anything to decide. But you do need your own 12 weeks first, which you are already in.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="background-color:#EADFCB;padding:32px 44px 34px;"><img src="https://songdance.co/brand/logo-wordmark-dark.png" width="130" alt="Songdance" style="width:130px;height:auto;margin:0 0 18px;"><p style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A6A78;margin:0 0 18px;">The sound was always yours.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#7A6A78;margin:0 0 6px;">Three emails about this, the last one on Monday. Not for you? <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#7A6A78;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a> and you won&rsquo;t hear from this list again.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#9A8A78;margin:0;">Songdance BV &middot; Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium<br>BE0743575076</p></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
